{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Nutty Dungeons",
    "steam_appid": 2960390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/extras/5ac1958e19098e1058785727c7f1b036.avif?t=1744332586\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORPORATE-MANDATED CARTOON MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nutty Dungeons</strong> is a cartoony 3D action platformer with a fully-featured level editor. Everything you play was made in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest (and fluffiest) employee of <strong>Bold &amp; Co.</strong> \u2014 the premier kobold dungeon manufactory \u2014 you're one part design contractor, one part guinea pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, create  your own absurd challenges with the <strong>Dungeon Maker.\u00a0</strong>Then, report to Faye the receptionist for some corporate-mandated\u00a0<strong>dungeon testing</strong>. You remembered to wear your heart boxers, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OBLIGATORY FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own dungeons</strong> with a fun and intuitive 3D level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wire parts together</strong>  to make traps, puzzles, machines, or pandemonium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Publish your designs to the Steam Workshop</strong> and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a tight platforming moveset</strong> to conquer Workshop dungeons and rack up loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a tasteful blend</strong> of retro mascot-platformer spirit and modern UX sensibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kobolds</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960390/extras/5ac1958e19098e1058785727c7f1b036.avif?t=1744332586\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CORPORATE-MANDATED CARTOON MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nutty Dungeons</strong> is a cartoony 3D action platformer with a fully-featured level editor. Everything you play was made in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest (and fluffiest) employee of <strong>Bold &amp; Co.</strong> \u2014 the premier kobold dungeon manufactory \u2014 you're one part design contractor, one part guinea pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, create  your own absurd challenges with the <strong>Dungeon Maker.\u00a0</strong>Then, report to Faye the receptionist for some corporate-mandated\u00a0<strong>dungeon testing</strong>. You remembered to wear your heart boxers, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OBLIGATORY FEATURE LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your own dungeons</strong> with a fun and intuitive 3D level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wire parts together</strong>  to make traps, puzzles, machines, or pandemonium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Publish your designs to the Steam Workshop</strong> and share them with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a tight platforming moveset</strong> to conquer Workshop dungeons and rack up loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a tasteful blend</strong> of retro mascot-platformer spirit and modern UX sensibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kobolds</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bold &amp; Co. needs YOU for the Dungeon Design Initiative! Use 50+ cartoony parts to create your own action-platforming challenges in the Dungeon Maker \u2014 or grab your sword and shield and test dungeons uploaded by kobolds all over the world.",
